"start": 315.046,
"end": 323.502,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano components within that system, the compromise becomes apparent \u2013 I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5279,
"char_end": 5435,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 323.502,
"end": 326.486,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 5452,
"char_end": 5510,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 326.486,
"end": 330.036,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do maintenance and the mechanics of the transmission intersect?",
"char_start": 5511,
"char_end": 5580,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 330.036,
"end": 335.733,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 5595,
"char_end": 5681,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 335.733,
"end": 340.436,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 5682,
"char_end": 5753,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 340.436,
"end": 345.563,
